title ALES166 — Lotus's stereo_compress_env_hold: the attack/hold/release compressor carried into stereo, the linked held envelope driving one linked gain over time — the first spender of the held time base
prompt Take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first; approve my own design rounds and make progress before checking in; send each finished increment as its own signed round; stop at the custody gates.
think ALES165 gave the linked detector its hold — the patient time base the stereo held-dynamics family waits for. Crux-first, the first rung to SPEND it is the attack/hold/release compressor, the representative member (its gain is nonlinear in loudness), exactly the stereo mirror of ALES58 (mono held compressor = mono breathing compressor ALES53 driven from the held mono follower ALES56).
think The un-held stereo compressor ALES161 pumps the whole field when a loud passage momentarily ducks below the threshold; the shared hold pins the peak so the gain reduction stays engaged through the duck. Because the detector is one shared held envelope, the two channels never release on different samples — the fix that steadies the level also keeps the image aligned.
think The shape composes two proofs over public APIs, adding only the hold knob: stereo_hold_env.stereo_env_step_hold advances the one shared envelope with the one shared hold countdown toward the linked peak; where the held envelope crosses the threshold, ALES50's softened ceiling comp = thr + excess·den/num on the ENVELOPE yields one gain comp/e to BOTH raw samples.
obs GREEN first run. Six laws GREEN on metal: the zero-hold law (hold=0 reduces to ALES161's stereo_compress_env byte for byte on both, run against the real tool — the held rung's no-hold limit exactly the un-held one already proven); the linked-gain-over-time law (a left-always-peak master has left' == ALES58's mono compress_env_hold(left), the right scaled by the same fraction comp/e, the independent per-channel differing); the image law (out-of-phase pair returns still out of phase, no expand, no sign flip); the knob/no-pump laws (unit ratio identity, a nonzero hold keeping the gain engaged across a duck where the un-held pumps — held no larger everywhere, strictly quieter at the duck); the carry law (split mid-hold == whole once on both, env AND hold_left carrying); the sub-threshold/silence/balance/atomicity(five refusals incl BadHold)/degenerate law.
obs StereoCompressEnvHoldError = compress_env_hold.CompressEnvHoldError (BadThreshold, BadRatio, BadCoeff, BadHold, BadRange) reused whole; the fusion adds no fault. Purely local, siloed to lotus/; gain comp/e in (0,1], i64 no overflow. No custody gate reached — a self-approved design round. TAME bans clean; the module carries asserts.
loom witness=ales_stereo_compress_env_hold_witness green=1 module=lotus/stereo_compress_env_hold.rye laws=6
