file tools/ales_stereo_compress_env_hold_witness.rish the trilingual witness (EN · Radiant · TAME), build + selftest GREEN gate
recommend keep-going — the first held spender is proven; the next crux on the ALES ladder is the rest of the held-dynamics family (stereo_gate_env_hold, then stereo_limit_env_hold and stereo_expand_env_hold), the same fusion of ALES162–164's linked gains over the added hold, single-module, policy written, no seam.
